Deployment scenarios (assumed; who pays is a commercial decision this PoC can inform but not settle)
  S1: Precisely-hosted: Precisely pays hosting, operations and LLM tokens; the customer pays the price passed through (not modeled)
  S2: Precisely-hosted matcher with the customer's own LLM key (BYOK): Precisely pays hosting and operations; the customer pays LLM tokens
  S3: Customer self-hosted or on-prem: the customer pays hardware, operations and LLM tokens only if they connect their own key; Precisely pays development and support (not modeled)
