Throughput: B at 100K records/day needs 2,008,540 calls a day = 1,395 calls per minute (23.2 per second; about 22 requests in flight at the measured p50 latency of 0.95 s). 1M and 10M records/day need 10x and 100x that. D needs 118 calls per minute at 10M records/day.

